menu "Drink Butler board"

    config ADB_TARGET_EMULATOR
        bool "Build for the QEMU emulator instead of the ES3C35P"
        default n
        help
            Swaps the board's ST77922 panel, touch, audio, battery ADC and sleep for
            emulator versions (bsp_emulator.c): Espressif QEMU's virtual RGB display,
            a pointer driven over the serial console, silent audio, a fixed battery
            reading and simulated sleep. Set by sdkconfig.emulator; see EMULATOR.md.
            The real-board build never sets this and compiles the same files as before.

endmenu
